  },
  {
   "id": "r051",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2834,
   "src": "«the base plate should be of equal or greater thickness than the shear lug».\nEs el estado limite que mas veces fija el espesor de la placa, y no se\ndescubre calculando la placa: hay que venir a buscarlo aca"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_regla_espesor",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2928,
   "src": "v_regla_espesor := t_bp >= t_sl ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r053",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 2974,
   "src": "━━ 1 — EXCENTRICIDAD DEL CORTE · DG1 Ej. 4.7-5 paso 1 ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r054",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3020,
   "src": "El aplastamiento no actua en toda la altura de la llave: el §17.11.2.1.1 topa\nel area efectiva a 2*t_sl de profundidad. Esa es la altura con que trabaja\nTODO el resto de la hoja, no h_sl"
  },
  {
   "id": "r055",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3114,
   "src": "hef_sl := min(h_sl, 2*t_sl) = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r056",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3160,
   "src": "perdida_h := 1 - hef_sl/h_sl ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r057",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3206,
   "src": "La resultante de aplastamiento se ubica a media altura efectiva, y el mortero\nsuma brazo: el corte actua excentrico respecto de la cara de la placa"
  },
  {
   "id": "r058",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3278,
   "src": "exc := t_gr + hef_sl/2 = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r059",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3324,
   "src": "M_ux := V_ux*exc = kN*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r060",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3370,
   "src": "M_uy := V_uy*exc = kN*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r061",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3416,
   "src": "━━ 2 — EMBEBIDO MINIMO DE LOS PERNOS · ACI §17.11.1.1.8 ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r062",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3462,
   "src": "Dos condiciones prescriptivas: (a) h_ef/h_sl >= 2,5 y (b) h_ef/c_sl >= 2,5"
  },
  {
   "id": "r063",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3508,
   "src": "hef_min1 := 2.5*h_sl = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r064",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3554,
   "src": "hef_minX := 2.5*csl_X = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r065",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3600,
   "src": "hef_minY := 2.5*csl_Y = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r066",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3646,
   "src": "hef_req := max(hef_min1, hef_minX, hef_minY) = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_embebido",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3692,
   "src": "v_embebido := h_ef >= hef_req ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r068",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3738,
   "src": "Y tiene que caber en el pedestal: el perno se hormigona con el, y un embebido\nmayor que el canto obliga a bajar a la zapata o a alargar el pedestal"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_cabe_pedestal",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3810,
   "src": "v_cabe_pedestal := h_ef <= H_PED ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r070",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3856,
   "src": "━━ 3 — APLASTAMIENTO DEL HORMIGON · ACI §17.11.2.1 ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r071",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3902,
   "src": "phi*V_brg = phi*1,7*f'c*A_ef_sl*psi_brg. OJO con el 1,7: no es el 0,85 del\naplastamiento general del §J8, es otra expresion y otro coeficiente"
  },
  {
   "id": "r072",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 3974,
   "src": "phi_brg := 0.65"
  },
  {
   "id": "r073",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4020,
   "src": "A_efx := bY_sl*hef_sl = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r074",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4066,
   "src": "A_efy := bX_sl*hef_sl = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r075",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4112,
   "src": "[17.11.2.2.1c] psi_brg = 1 + 4*P_u/(A_bp*f'c), topado en 2,0. A_bp es el area\ncomprimida bajo la placa, no el area total: por eso hace falta Yb"
  },
  {
   "id": "r076",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4184,
   "src": "A_bp := Yb*B_bp = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r077",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4230,
   "src": "psi_x := min(1 + 4*P_ux/(A_bp*fpc), 2.0) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r078",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4276,
   "src": "psi_y := min(1 + 4*P_uy/(A_bp*fpc), 2.0) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r079",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4322,
   "src": "phiVbrg_x := phi_brg*1.7*fpc*A_efx*psi_x = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r080",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4368,
   "src": "phiVbrg_y := phi_brg*1.7*fpc*A_efy*psi_y = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r081",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4414,
   "src": "u_brgx := V_ux/phiVbrg_x ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r082",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4460,
   "src": "u_brgy := V_uy/phiVbrg_y ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_brgx",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4506,
   "src": "v_brgx := phiVbrg_x >= V_ux ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_brgy",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4552,
   "src": "v_brgy := phiVbrg_y >= V_uy ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r085",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4598,
   "src": "━━ 4 — BREAKOUT DE CORTE DEL HORMIGON · ACI §17.11.3 ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r086",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4644,
   "src": "c_a1 se mide desde la superficie de aplastamiento al borde libre, EN LA\nDIRECCION DEL CORTE. Con dos chapas paralelas la mas cercana al borde es la\ncritica, y su c_a1 se acorta en y_chapa"
  },
  {
   "id": "r087",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4738,
   "src": "ca1_x := (PED_X - t_sl)/2 = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r088",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4784,
   "src": "ca1_y := (PED_Y - t_sl)/2 - y_chapa = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r089",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4830,
   "src": "[17.11.3.1.1] A_Vc = (h_ef_sl + 1,5*c_a1)*(b_sl + 3*c_a1) - h_ef_sl*b_sl\ny A_Vco = 4,5*c_a1^2. Usa la profundidad TOPADA hef_sl, no h_sl"
  },
  {
   "id": "r090",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4902,
   "src": "AVc_x := (hef_sl + 1.5*ca1_x)*(bY_sl + 3*ca1_x) - hef_sl*bY_sl = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r091",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4948,
   "src": "AVco_x := 4.5*ca1_x^2 = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r092",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 4994,
   "src": "AVc_y := (hef_sl + 1.5*ca1_y)*(bX_sl + 3*ca1_y) - hef_sl*bX_sl = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r093",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5040,
   "src": "AVco_y := 4.5*ca1_y^2 = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r094",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5086,
   "src": "[17.7.2.2.1b] V_b = 3,7*lambda*sqrt(f'c)*c_a1^1,5, en newton con mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r095",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5132,
   "src": "ca1x_n := ca1_x/(1 mm) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r096",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5178,
   "src": "ca1y_n := ca1_y/(1 mm) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r097",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5224,
   "src": "Vb_x := 3.7*lambda_a*raiz_fpc*ca1x_n^1.5*(1 N) = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r098",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5270,
   "src": "Vb_y := 3.7*lambda_a*raiz_fpc*ca1y_n^1.5*(1 N) = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r099",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5316,
   "src": "phiVcb_x := phi_brg*(AVc_x/AVco_x)*Vb_x = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r100",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5362,
   "src": "phiVcb_y := phi_brg*(AVc_y/AVco_y)*Vb_y = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r101",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5408,
   "src": "u_cbx := V_ux/phiVcb_x ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r102",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5454,
   "src": "u_cby := V_uy/phiVcb_y ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_cbx",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5500,
   "src": "v_cbx := phiVcb_x >= V_ux ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_cby",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5546,
   "src": "v_cby := phiVcb_y >= V_uy ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r105",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5592,
   "src": "SI ALGUNO NO PASA: no es un problema de acero. Ensanchar el pedestal en la\ndireccion del corte, o acreditar armadura de anclaje — bloque 8"
  },
  {
   "id": "r106",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5664,
   "src": "━━ 4b — DOS CHAPAS PARALELAS · ACI §17.11.2.4 ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r107",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5710,
   "src": "El aplastamiento de dos llaves es ADITIVO solo si la tension de corte en el\nplano de hormigon que queda entre ellas no supera 0,2*f'c. Con n_chapas := 1\nla comprobacion no aplica y la hoja devuelve holgura plena"
  },
  {
   "id": "r108",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5804,
   "src": "tau_plano :=\n    if n_chapas == 1\n        return 0 MPa\n    else\n        luz := 2*y_chapa - t_sl\n        return V_uy/(luz*bX_sl)"
  },
  {
   "id": "r109",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 5964,
   "src": "tau_lim := 0.2*fpc = MPa"
  },
  {
   "id": "v_aditividad",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6010,
   "src": "v_aditividad := tau_lim >= tau_plano ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r111",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6056,
   "src": "━━ 5 — ACERO DE LA CHAPA DE LA LLAVE · AISC 360 §J4.2 y §J4.5 ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r112",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6102,
   "src": "La chapa trabaja como voladizo empotrado en la placa, con el momento M = V*e\ndel bloque 1 y el corte V en su seccion de arranque"
  },
  {
   "id": "r113",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6174,
   "src": "Z_slx := bY_sl*t_sl^2/4 = mm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r114",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6220,
   "src": "Z_sly := bX_sl*t_sl^2/4 = mm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r115",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6266,
   "src": "[J4-1] fluencia en flexion con phi = 0,90 y rotura con phi = 0,75: manda el menor"
  },
  {
   "id": "r116",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6312,
   "src": "phiMn_slx := min(0.90*Fy_ac*Z_slx, 0.75*Fu_ac*Z_slx) = kN*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r117",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6358,
   "src": "phiMn_sly := min(0.90*Fy_ac*Z_sly, 0.75*Fu_ac*Z_sly) = kN*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r118",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6404,
   "src": "[J4-3] fluencia en corte: V_n = 0,60*F_y*A_gv con phi = 1,00"
  },
  {
   "id": "r119",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6450,
   "src": "phiVn_slx := 1.00*0.60*Fy_ac*bY_sl*t_sl = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r120",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6496,
   "src": "phiVn_sly := 1.00*0.60*Fy_ac*bX_sl*t_sl = kN"
  },
  {
   "id": "r121",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6542,
   "src": "u_flexslx := M_ux/phiMn_slx ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r122",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6588,
   "src": "u_flexsly := M_uy/phiMn_sly ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_flexslx",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6634,
   "src": "v_flexslx := phiMn_slx >= M_ux ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_flexsly",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6680,
   "src": "v_flexsly := phiMn_sly >= M_uy ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r125",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6726,
   "src": "[Manual Ec. 9-1] interaccion M-V: M_r/M_c + (V_r/V_c)^4 <= 1,0"
  },
  {
   "id": "r126",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6772,
   "src": "int_x := u_flexslx + (V_ux/phiVn_slx)^4 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r127",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6818,
   "src": "int_y := u_flexsly + (V_uy/phiVn_sly)^4 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_intx",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6864,
   "src": "v_intx := int_x <= 1.0 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_inty",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6910,
   "src": "v_inty := int_y <= 1.0 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r130",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 6956,
   "src": "━━ 6 — SOLDADURA LLAVE-PLACA · AISC 360 §J2 ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r131",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7002,
   "src": "Dos cordones de filete, uno a cada cara. El momento se toma como par sobre\nsus centroides, separados a = t_sl + 2w/3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r132",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7074,
   "src": "a_par := t_sl + 2*w_sold/3 = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r133",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7120,
   "src": "[J2-5] incremento direccional k_ds = 1,0 + 0,50*sin(theta)^1,5, con theta = 90\ngrados porque la fuerza es perpendicular al eje del cordon"
  },
  {
   "id": "r134",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7192,
   "src": "k_ds := 1.0 + 0.50*sin(90 deg)^1.5 ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r135",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7238,
   "src": "r_adm := 0.75*0.60*FEXX*(w_sold/sqrt(2))*k_ds = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r136",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7284,
   "src": "ruv_x := V_ux/(2*bY_sl) = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r137",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7330,
   "src": "rum_x := M_ux/(a_par*bY_sl) = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r138",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7376,
   "src": "ru_x := sqrt(ruv_x^2 + rum_x^2) = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r139",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7422,
   "src": "ruv_y := V_uy/(2*bX_sl) = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r140",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7468,
   "src": "rum_y := M_uy/(a_par*bX_sl) = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r141",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7514,
   "src": "ru_y := sqrt(ruv_y^2 + rum_y^2) = kN/mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r142",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7560,
   "src": "u_soldx := ru_x/r_adm ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r143",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7606,
   "src": "u_soldy := ru_y/r_adm ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_soldx",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7652,
   "src": "v_soldx := r_adm >= ru_x ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_soldy",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7698,
   "src": "v_soldy := r_adm >= ru_y ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r146",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7744,
   "src": "━━ 7 — FLEXION LOCAL DE LA PLACA BASE · DG1 Ej. 4.7-5 paso 7 ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r147",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7790,
   "src": "El mismo M = V*e flexiona la PLACA, con el ancho de la llave como ancho\neficaz. Es la segunda via por la que la llave fija el espesor de la placa"
  },
  {
   "id": "r148",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7862,
   "src": "Z_bpx := bY_sl*t_bp^2/4 = mm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r149",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7908,
   "src": "Z_bpy := bX_sl*t_bp^2/4 = mm^3"
  },
  {
   "id": "r150",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 7954,
   "src": "phiMn_bpx := 0.90*Fy_ac*Z_bpx = kN*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r151",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8000,
   "src": "phiMn_bpy := 0.90*Fy_ac*Z_bpy = kN*m"
  },
  {
   "id": "r152",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8046,
   "src": "u_bpx := M_ux/phiMn_bpx ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r153",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8092,
   "src": "u_bpy := M_uy/phiMn_bpy ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_bpx",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8138,
   "src": "v_bpx := phiMn_bpx >= M_ux ="
  },
  {
   "id": "v_bpy",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8184,
   "src": "v_bpy := phiMn_bpy >= M_uy ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r156",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8230,
   "src": "Espesor de placa que pide la llave por esta via, para compararlo con el que\npide el aplastamiento en placa-base-generica: manda el mayor de los dos"
  },
  {
   "id": "r157",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8302,
   "src": "tbp_req_x := sqrt(4*M_ux/(0.90*Fy_ac*bY_sl)) = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r158",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8348,
   "src": "tbp_req_y := sqrt(4*M_uy/(0.90*Fy_ac*bX_sl)) = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r159",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8394,
   "src": "tbp_req := max(tbp_req_x, tbp_req_y, t_sl) = mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r160",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8440,
   "src": "━━ 8 — SI EL BREAKOUT NO CIERRA · ACI §17.5.2.1.2 ━━",
   "pageBreak": true
  },
  {
   "id": "r161",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8486,
   "src": "La armadura de anclaje sustituye a la resistencia de breakout del hormigon:\nestribos horizontales proximos a la cara superior, dentro del cono de falla y\ndesarrollados a AMBOS lados de la superficie teorica. phi = 0,75"
  },
  {
   "id": "r162",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8580,
   "src": "phi_arm := 0.75"
  },
  {
   "id": "r163",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8626,
   "src": "As_reqx := V_ux/(phi_arm*fy_arm) = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r164",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8672,
   "src": "As_reqy := V_uy/(phi_arm*fy_arm) = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r165",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8718,
   "src": "Traducido a ramas de estribo, para dimensionar el despiece. El R17.5.2.1.2\npide diametro MENOR que el de la armadura longitudinal del pedestal"
  },
  {
   "id": "r166",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8790,
   "src": "db_est := 12 mm"
  },
  {
   "id": "r167",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8836,
   "src": "A_est := pi*db_est^2/4 = mm^2"
  },
  {
   "id": "r168",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8882,
   "src": "n_ramas_x := ceil(As_reqx/A_est) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r169",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8928,
   "src": "n_ramas_y := ceil(As_reqy/A_est) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r170",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 8974,
   "src": "ESTAS RAMAS COMPITEN POR EL ESPACIO QUE LA LLAVE YA OCUPA: van en los\nprimeros milimetros bajo la cara superior, que es justo donde penetra la\nllave. Las dos cosas se resuelven en el mismo plano de taller"
  },
  {
   "id": "r171",
   "kind": "text",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9068,
   "src": "━━ QUE GOBIERNA ━━"
  },
  {
   "id": "r172",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9114,
   "src": "u_max := max(u_brgx, u_brgy, u_cbx, u_cby, int_x, int_y, u_soldx, u_soldy, u_bpx, u_bpy) ="
  },
  {
   "id": "r173",
   "kind": "program",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9160,
   "src": "gobierna :=\n    if u_max == u_cbx\n        return \"breakout de corte en X: depende del ancho del pedestal\"\n    else if u_max == u_cby\n        return \"breakout de corte en Y: depende del ancho del pedestal\"\n    else if u_max == int_x\n        return \"flexion de la chapa de la llave en X\"\n    else if u_max == int_y\n        return \"flexion de la chapa de la llave en Y\"\n    else if u_max == u_bpx\n        return \"flexion local de la placa base en X\"\n    else if u_max == u_bpy\n        return \"flexion local de la placa base en Y\"\n    else if u_max == u_soldx\n        return \"soldadura llave-placa en X\"\n    else if u_max == u_soldy\n        return \"soldadura llave-placa en Y\"\n    else\n        return \"aplastamiento del hormigon\""
  },
  {
   "id": "v_global",
   "kind": "math",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 9606,
   "src": "v_global := u_max <= 1 ="
  }
 ]
}
